## 9. Work-From-Home and Attendance

### 9.1 Work-From-Home and Leave

- Work-from-home days are **not considered leave**
- The employee is expected to work their full 8-hour day from home
- Attendance is recorded via check-in/check-out in HRIS
- If an employee is sick and cannot work (even from home), sick leave should be taken

### 9.2 Leave While On Approved Work-From-Home

- Employees can take leave (annual, sick, casual) on their designated work-from-home days
- The leave is recorded and deducted from the leave balance as usual
- No difference in leave processing based on location (office or remote)

